# Styling Conventions

This project uses vanilla CSS with CSS custom properties. No Tailwind or CSS frameworks are used.

## CSS Architecture

### Global Styles

**File**: `src/styles/global.css`

- Defines CSS custom properties (variables) for colors, spacing, typography
- Sets up theme system with `[data-theme]` selectors
- Includes base typography, layout utilities, and responsive design variables
- Inter font loaded from Google Fonts

### Print Styles

**File**: `src/styles/print.css`

- Separate stylesheet for print/PDF output
- Uses `@media print` queries
- Optimized for A4 page format
- Hides navigation and interactive elements
- Print-optimized typography and spacing

## Theme System

The theme system uses CSS custom properties and `data-theme` attribute:

```css
:root {
  /* Light theme variables */
  --color-bg: #fbfbff;
  --color-text: #18181b;
  /* ... */
}

[data-theme="dark"] {
  /* Dark theme overrides */
  --color-bg: #0f172a;
  --color-text: #f1f5f9;
  /* ... */
}
```

The `<html>` element has `data-theme="light"` or `data-theme="dark"` set dynamically via JavaScript.

## CSS Custom Properties

### Color Variables

- `--color-bg`: Background color
- `--color-text`: Primary text color
- `--color-text-secondary`: Secondary text color
- `--color-accent`: Primary accent color
- `--color-accent-gradient`: Gradient for accents
- `--color-border`: Border color
- `--color-card-bg`: Card background color
- `--color-shadow`: Shadow color

### Spacing Variables

- `--spacing-xs`: 0.5rem
- `--spacing-sm`: 1rem
- `--spacing-md`: 2rem
- `--spacing-lg`: 4rem
- `--spacing-xl`: 6rem

### Typography Variables

- `--font-family`: Inter font stack
- `--font-size-base`: 1rem
- `--font-size-sm`: 0.875rem
- `--font-size-lg`: 1.125rem
- `--font-size-xl`: 1.25rem
- `--font-size-2xl`: 1.5rem
- `--font-size-3xl`: 2rem
- `--font-size-4xl`: 2.5rem

### Layout Variables

- `--max-width`: 1200px (container max width)
- `--content-width`: 800px (content max width)

## Component Styles

Components use scoped `<style>` blocks within `.astro` files:

```astro
<style>
  .component-name {
    /* Use CSS variables */
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
  }
</style>
```

## Responsive Design

- Use `clamp()` for fluid typography: `font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);`
- Use CSS variables for responsive spacing
- Media queries for breakpoints: `@media (max-width: 768px)`

## Print Styles

Print styles (`src/styles/print.css`) are imported in `Layout.astro` and include:

- A4 page setup with `@page` rules
- Hides navigation, theme toggle, and interactive elements
- Optimizes typography for print (pt units)
- Controls page breaks
- Removes backgrounds and shadows

## Best Practices

- ✅ Always use CSS custom properties instead of hardcoded values
- ✅ Use semantic variable names (`--color-text`, not `--blue`)
- ✅ Keep component styles scoped in `<style>` blocks
- ✅ Use `clamp()` for responsive typography
- ✅ Include print styles when components have print-specific needs
- ❌ Don't use Tailwind or other CSS frameworks
- ❌ Don't use inline styles (except for dynamic values)
- ❌ Don't duplicate color/spacing values — use variables
